# Contexto de build desde la raíz del repo (despliegue en Fly: infra/fly/Dockerfile).
# Lista blanca: solo lo que entra a la imagen del motor. (Los builds de services/engine usan su propio .dockerignore.)
*
!services/engine/pyproject.toml
!services/engine/uv.lock
!services/engine/.python-version
!services/engine/README.md
!services/engine/gen/**
!services/engine/lumen_engine/**
!data/catalog/sites.yaml
**/__pycache__
